  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Country Fund For Capacity Development in Macroeconomic Policies and Statistics &amp;#8211; Phase II: Addendum no. 2 top up and extension.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Somalia Country Fund For Capacity Development in Macroeconomic Policies and Statistics &amp;#8211; Phase II: Addendum no. 2 top up and extension. - The Overall Objective (Impact) of this action is improved the effectiveness and responsiveness of nascent Somali public institutions in performing core state functions. The Specific Objective (Outcome) of this action is improved Government capacity and allocation of resources to deliver basic social services (with a focus on education). The Induced Outputs (IO) to be delivered by this action are (1) Enhanced revenue-sharing arrangements, fiscal transfers and equalization mechanisms; (2) Increased Mobilisation of Domestic Revenue; (3) Enhanced  public financial management and accountability for public funds; and (4) Enhanced state contribution to the provision of education services in the country, by increasing its funding for public sector education, and bolstering its regulatory capacity to enhance quality, access, and targeting of education services overall. The Direct Outputs (DO) to be delivered by this action are increased fiscal space for funding to basic services; enhanced government capacity to mobilise domestic revenues, manage and account for the use of public funds, manage intergovernmental fiscal transfers, and enhanced capacity and framework to manage teachers.</narrative>
  </description>
